  "_about": "The asset kit (lane B3): pieces used on every map. One entry per piece; the builder named in \"builder\" (scripts/world/kit/kit.gd) makes its mesh, collision and anchors from the numbers here, so a new rock, wall or ruin is one entry. \"collision\": convex (hull of the mesh), boxes (one box per break piece), none. \"climb\": the legs can grip it. \"grapple\": wire anchors hold on it (physics layer 7, grapple_surface). \"break\": built from separate pieces that Kit.break_apart() turns into loose debris (for lane B5). Materials are in the \"materials\" block; their texture sets are CC0 from ambientCG (see assets/SOURCES.md).",
